BlindPost.prompt:
Whiteboard board_id=${vars.board_id}. Phase doc path: ${vars.phase_doc_path}
Phase doc text:
${vars.phase_doc_text}
Evidence bundle JSON:
${vars.evidence_bundle}
Acceptance criteria JSON:
${vars.acceptance_criteria}
Target context window: ${vars.target_context_window}

Post one blind `proposal` to the whiteboard. Use your registered alias as agent_name exactly: architecture, implementation, or risk. Do not use your brofile name. Do not call whiteboard_register. Your post must include proposed sub-units, refs, acceptance_subset ids, dependencies, predicted writes, and risks. Do not edit files.

SynthesizeDag.prompt:
Whiteboard board_id=${vars.board_id}. Board summary JSON:
${vars.board_summary}

Read full board state if needed. Evidence bundle JSON:
${vars.evidence_bundle}
Acceptance criteria JSON:
${vars.acceptance_criteria}
Target context window: ${vars.target_context_window}

Return strict JSON only: {"sub_units":[...],"recompose_contract":{...}}. Each sub-unit requires sub_unit_id,title,refs,bytes,acceptance_subset,depends_on,predicted_writes; no assigned_brofile. Use bbox_ref_size for every candidate ref cluster; every bytes value must equal measured ref sum and be <= target_context_window. Split/narrow refs until true. Parent ACs may repeat; repeated criterion_text must describe the local slice. AC-DECOMP-3: supervised sub-units validate foreach/supervised or recompose artifact wiring only; final live Recompose terminal verdict is checked by parent recompose_contract after foreach drains, so no sub-unit may depend on observing it. Ignore scout/content-preview/post byte counts; only bbox_ref_size from this run counts. Every resolved ref in evidence_bundle.refs must appear in at least one measured sub-unit refs list unless it is carried as an unresolved degraded ref in evidence_bundle.degraded.unresolved_refs; lint enforces this. Do not put a ref in degraded_refs just because a scout or post claimed it was unresolved; if this run bbox_ref_size resolves it, include it in sub_unit.refs with measured bytes. Prefer AC-local clusters; split clusters over target_context_window. Copy evidence_bundle.degraded.unresolved_refs into recompose_contract.degraded_refs. cross_subunit_tests must include terminal_verdicts exactly ["satisfied","work_remains","untenable"] and assertions for foreach drain plus recompose verdict. Epoch-ceiling halt never satisfies AC-DECOMP-3. No notes/tools except measurement; no prose/fences/duplicate JSON.
